  m_text: 'The player becomes a fighter pilot who must maneuver in the sky, dodging
    flying missiles. The player must overcome dangerous airspaces, where enemies
    launch missiles to shoot down the plane. Using agility and reaction, you need
    to avoid collisions, collect bonuses to improve the characteristics of the plane
    and complete exciting missions. With each level, the difficulty increases: missiles
    become faster, and enemies are more cunning. Will you be able to survive this
    adrenaline-fueled air battle? Take your plane into the sky and prove that you
    are the best pilot!                                 '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e21d9fa883341484f8393b51730ca170, type: 2}
